{"4464760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Formula 2026: Rise of Legends", "steam_appid": 4464760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A LEGEND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit of next-generation open-wheel machines and experience racing at its absolute limit. In Formula 2026: Rise of Legends, every corner matters, every overtake counts, and every millisecond can define your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From rookie driver to world champion — your journey begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/757f59da92524f12c63c2c3f45a8eb54.poster.avif?t=1779879139\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/757f59da92524f12c63c2c3f45a8eb54.webm?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/757f59da92524f12c63c2c3f45a8eb54.mp4?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER EVERY MOMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing at the limit means mistakes can happen. With the <strong>Rewind system</strong>, you can instantly reverse time and retry critical moments on the track. Perfect your racing line, recover from errors, and push your limits without losing the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rewind time to retry difficult corners<br>• Correct mistakes and improve your racing skills<br>• Experiment with different racing lines and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn. Adapt. Dominate the track.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURE SPEED. TOTAL CONTROL.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience competitive racing built around precision handling and high-speed stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Responsive and skill-based driving physics<br>• Wheel-to-wheel battles at extreme speeds<br>• Advanced grip and aerodynamic balance<br>• Immersive cockpit view and dynamic camera angles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the apex. Defend your position. Push beyond the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/df7a1f83d222ffac612daec045ec5dc9.poster.avif?t=1779879139\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/df7a1f83d222ffac612daec045ec5dc9.webm?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/df7a1f83d222ffac612daec045ec5dc9.mp4?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RACE YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Career Mode – Climb from unknown driver to world champion<br>• Quick Race – Jump straight into the action<br>• Multiple circuits inspired by real-world racing venues<br>• Competitive AI opponents<br>• Full controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/5f0fc2e42d4bafde4a5c57867ac09ff4.poster.avif?t=1779879139\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/5f0fc2e42d4bafde4a5c57867ac09ff4.webm?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/5f0fc2e42d4bafde4a5c57867ac09ff4.mp4?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE RACING ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Detailed open-wheel cars<br>• Realistic lighting conditions<br>• High-speed motion effects<br>• Intense on-track battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is not given. It is earned — corner by corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to rise?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A LEGEND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit of next-generation open-wheel machines and experience racing at its absolute limit. In Formula 2026: Rise of Legends, every corner matters, every overtake counts, and every millisecond can define your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From rookie driver to world champion — your journey begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/757f59da92524f12c63c2c3f45a8eb54.poster.avif?t=1779879139\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/757f59da92524f12c63c2c3f45a8eb54.webm?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/757f59da92524f12c63c2c3f45a8eb54.mp4?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER EVERY MOMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing at the limit means mistakes can happen. With the <strong>Rewind system</strong>, you can instantly reverse time and retry critical moments on the track. Perfect your racing line, recover from errors, and push your limits without losing the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rewind time to retry difficult corners<br>• Correct mistakes and improve your racing skills<br>• Experiment with different racing lines and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn. Adapt. Dominate the track.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURE SPEED. TOTAL CONTROL.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience competitive racing built around precision handling and high-speed stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Responsive and skill-based driving physics<br>• Wheel-to-wheel battles at extreme speeds<br>• Advanced grip and aerodynamic balance<br>• Immersive cockpit view and dynamic camera angles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the apex. Defend your position. Push beyond the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/df7a1f83d222ffac612daec045ec5dc9.poster.avif?t=1779879139\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/df7a1f83d222ffac612daec045ec5dc9.webm?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/df7a1f83d222ffac612daec045ec5dc9.mp4?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RACE YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Career Mode – Climb from unknown driver to world champion<br>• Quick Race – Jump straight into the action<br>• Multiple circuits inspired by real-world racing venues<br>• Competitive AI opponents<br>• Full controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/5f0fc2e42d4bafde4a5c57867ac09ff4.poster.avif?t=1779879139\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/5f0fc2e42d4bafde4a5c57867ac09ff4.webm?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/extras/5f0fc2e42d4bafde4a5c57867ac09ff4.mp4?t=1779879139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE RACING ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Detailed open-wheel cars<br>• Realistic lighting conditions<br>• High-speed motion effects<br>• Intense on-track battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is not given. It is earned — corner by corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to rise?</p>", "short_description": "Formula 2026: Rise of Legends is a high-speed open-wheel racing experience where precision, control, and pure skill decide who becomes a champion. Master technical circuits, battle wheel-to-wheel, and rise through the ranks.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/8e29c33ce4fa7ca46a493b707f5955973bf0c778/header.jpg?t=1779879139", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/3f26e75217138da96858e1b4e72c4fd233843aa5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779879139", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464760/3f26e75217138da96858e1b4e72c4fd233843aa5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779879139", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 370 (2 GB VRAM)  DirectX: Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core